9. Scientific Use and Disclaimer
--------------------------------

HIP²LInterActomics is scientific software intended to assist with molecular
interaction analysis, interaction fingerprints, structural interpretation,
visualization, and related computational workflows.

The software and its generated results are provided without any guarantee
of scientific, experimental, clinical, diagnostic, therapeutic, regulatory,
commercial, or other fitness for a particular purpose.

Computational results depend on the quality of input molecular structures,
protonation states, molecular conformations, interaction definitions,
software versions, numerical parameters, and analysis settings.

Automated statistical analyses, clustering, feature importance,
fingerprint interpretation, or generated report text should not be
interpreted as experimental validation, causal evidence, medical advice,
or a substitute for expert scientific assessment.

The authors and contributors are not liable for conclusions, decisions,
losses, damages, or other consequences arising from use of the software or
its outputs, subject to the limitations and exclusions permitted under the
GNU General Public License and applicable law.


